{
  "id": 88096472,
  "iid": 2055,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Support Van Jacobson PPP compression (#12138)",
  "description": "A complete dissector for Van Jacobson PPP header compression:\n<ftp://ftp.rfc-editor.org/in-notes/rfc1144.pdf>\n\nThis dissector was created solely by reading the description of the protocol in section 3.2 of RFC 1144. In particular, I did *not* read the sample implementation of the RFC in its Appendix A, due to the questionable legality of using code with \"All rights reserved\" in Wireshark. See #12138 for details.\n\nCloses #12138",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2021-02-10T20:15:45.188Z",
